<title>JAPAN: Toyo Kanetsu - 96/97 parent results.</title>
<headline>Toyo Kanetsu - 96/97 parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 46.50		vs	   40.55</p>
<p> Operating     loss 1.07		vs     prft 1.46</p>
<p> Current	    749    million	  vs	    2.13</p>
