<p> EPS		    3.72 yen	  vs	    7.10 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	     -		vs		 -</p>
<p> Shares	    142 million	  vs	 140 million</p>
<p> Ord div		6.00 yen	  vs	    6.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Toyo Kanetsu Co Ltd is a storage tank builder. Its net was down 47.2 pct.</p>
